Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:32.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我找到这张老照片 希望有一天能听你说说你的故事）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.15,1:01:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去也没什么了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.02,1:01:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你也差不多
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.15,1:01:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼眸就和你的微笑一样温柔…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.70,1:01:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你的眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.61,1:01:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你想要什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.20,1:01:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会讲中文 姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.16,1:01:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能用古希腊语背诵苏格拉底的名言吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.92,1:03:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想要一张这位美人的照片
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.76,1:03:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要照片…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.85,1:03:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟你们一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.87,1:13:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我 求您了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.79,1:13:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抢走了一切…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.83,1:13:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子 食物…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.92,1:13:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些没能逃走的人…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.00,1:13:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓起来当奴隶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.05,1:13:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里发生的？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.38,1:13:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,费尔德 …在无人区另一端
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.14,2:13:01.81,Title,0,0,0,0,,《神奇女侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去我总想着拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to want to save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个美丽的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}This beautiful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可那时我涉世未深\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I knew so little then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一片奇妙非凡的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a land of magic and wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太值得被珍爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth cherishing in any way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你越是靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the closer you get, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越能看清 黑暗在蠢蠢欲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more you see the great darkness shimmering within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}And mankind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.57,0:01:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类又是另外一回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind is another story altogether.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道真相后要作出怎样的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}What one does when faced with truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想象中要困难很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}is more difficult than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是摸爬滚打才学会这个道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned this the hard way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那已经是很久以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不再是过去的我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never be the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}merci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊 戴安娜 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Diana. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还不错 - 很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She looks very good. - Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续操练 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep working. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼俄伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? Slow down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you back to school, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然这个老师也不教你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before another tutor quits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不觉得我应该开始训练了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, don't you think it's time to start my training?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提俄珀觉得我已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antiope thinks I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以开始教她些基本的招式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could begin showing her some things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.45,0:04:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她起码要有保护自己的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should at least be able to defend herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}From whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of an invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有史上最伟大的战士和她带领的部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that why I have the greatest warrior in our history{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不够吗 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading an entire army, General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷永远不会有战乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray they will never come to where she has to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要知道 是蝎子就会蛰咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know, a scorpion must sting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是狼就会扑杀 - 她还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A wolf must hunt. - She is a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这岛上唯一的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only child on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让她当一个孩子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let her be so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, mother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会小心的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I promise to be careful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用剑 行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I didn't use a sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,会战斗不代表你就是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting does not make you a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就只用盾 不用尖锐的兵器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the shield then, no sharp edges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 你对我来说是这世上最宝贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, you are the most precious thing in the world to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我渴望有个小生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wished for you so much, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以亲手用泥土塑造了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I sculpted you from clay myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,并恳求宙斯赋予你生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And begged Zeus to give you life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前跟我讲过这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've told me this story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以今晚我要给你讲个新的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why tonight I'll tell you a new one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于亚马逊人的历史和我们的战争年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story of our people and my days of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听完你就会明白 战争有多么可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you will finally understand why war is nothing to hope for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 世界初始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long ago, when time was new, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切历史都还没有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of history was still a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神统治着世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods ruled the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯则为众神之首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus king among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.05,0:06:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他创造了一种将被神统治的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus created beings over which the Gods will ruled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以他为原型打造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beings born in his image, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,公平善良 强壮 充满激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}fair and good, strong and passionate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯将他们称作「人」 人类天性善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called his creation "Man". And mankind was good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但宙斯的儿子却对他们心生嫉恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Zeus' son grew envious of mankind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,想方设法摧毁他父亲的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sought to corrupt his father's creation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是阿瑞斯 战争之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was Ares, the God of War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瑞斯用嫉妒和怀疑荼毒人们的心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares poisoned man's hearts with jealousy and suspicion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned them against one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.81,0:07:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,令战争肆虐各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And war ravaged the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 众神创造了我们亚马逊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the gods created us, the Amazons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们用爱意感化人们的心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}To influence men's hearts with love, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世界重现和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}and restore peace to the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有过一段短暂的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for a brief time, there was peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,却很快被打破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it did not last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的母亲亚马逊女王 发起了反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother, the Amazon Queen, led a revolt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们族人摆脱了奴役\N{\fnArial\fs30}that freed us all from enslavement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯率领众神来保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Zeus led the gods to our defence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们却相继被阿瑞斯杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares's killed them one by one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后只剩下宙斯一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}until only Zeus himself remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯拼尽全力阻止阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus used the last of his power to stop Ares, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动致命一击 战争之神不得不撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}striking such a blow, the god of war was forced to retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但宙斯明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Zeus knew, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,终有一日阿瑞斯会卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one day Ares might return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成他的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to finish his mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将是场无休止的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}An endless war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类将在自相残杀中灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}where mankind would finally destroy themselves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也将难逃厄运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and us with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 宙斯给我们留下了一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Zeus left us a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件足以杀死神的强大武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}One powerful enough to kill a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯用最后一口气 创造了这座岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his dying breath, zeus created this island, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我们与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hide us from the outside world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样阿瑞斯就无法找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere Ares could not find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此一切都平息了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all has been quiet ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们感恩众神赐予我们这样一座天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We give thanks to the gods for giving us this paradise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那弑神者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the God Killer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,弑神者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God Killer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.69,0:09:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件足以杀死神的强大武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapon that is strong enough to kill a God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神赐予了我们许多宝物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods gave us many gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 你都会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, you'll know them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座高塔就是我们的藏宝地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This great tower is where we keep them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,弑神者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会使用它呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would be wield it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望它永远不会被派上用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray it will never be called to arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有最勇猛的人才配拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only the fiercest among us even could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人不是你 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not you, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? You are safe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there is nothing you should concern yourself with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是不够自信 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep doubting yourself, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我没有 - 你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't. - Yes. You do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比自己想象的还要强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger than you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道自己有多大能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have greater powers than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果不努力些… - 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But if you don't try harder… - Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 母亲 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mother, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是在… - 训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just… - Training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来没有人把我这个女王放在眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems I'm not the revered queen I should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的亲妹妹都能违抗我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disobeyed, betrayed by my own sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 母亲 都怪我 是我让\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, mother. It was me. I asked her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她回宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我别无选择 希波吕忒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me no choice, Hippolyta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她不会战斗 那就是你的失职\N{\fnArial\fs30}You neglect your duty, if she cannot fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是遥不可及的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of a time that may never come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他不会回来 也许他受伤后就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might never return. He could have died from his wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瑞斯还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心底里跟我一样 都能感受得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel it as I do, in your bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他何时再现只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a matter of time before he returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她越强大 就越容易被他找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stronger she gets, the sooner he will find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,希波吕忒 我跟你一样爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hippolyta, I love her as you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有这样才能真正保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is the only way to truly protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你对她的训练就要比任何人都要严厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will train her harder than any Amazon before her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,严厉五倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five times harder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,严厉十倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}ten times harder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到比你还强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until she's better than even you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一定不能让她知道她的身世\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she must never know the truth about what she is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及她的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}or how she came to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可比这强 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are stronger than this, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要放松警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never let your guard down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为战斗是公平的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect the battle to be fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗没有公平可言的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battle will never be fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提俄珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antiope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 别过来 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Wait, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What had I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么大的雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did this fog come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那 前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Go forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个飞行员 我看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pilot! I can see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.75,0:18:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我看着不像男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I not look like one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temiscira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是好人 他们是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm one of the good guys and those are the bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是德国人 快走 我们得离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Germans. Come on, we need to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 德国人？- 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Germans? - Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from her now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,弓箭手准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready your bows!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们有枪的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have guns. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:18:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.10,0:20:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 安提俄珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Antiope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提俄珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antiope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.63,0:22:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you must…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.82,0:22:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 安提俄珀 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What, Antiope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.01,0:22:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,弑神者\N{\fnArial\fs30}God Killer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴安娜 快去… - 去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diana, go… - Go where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去哪 - 去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.67,0:22:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please no. No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 安提俄珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Antiope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.99,0:22:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.93,0:22:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样 母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No mother. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.01,0:22:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他帮我一起攻击了入侵者 - 谁会背叛自己人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He fought at my side against the invaders. - What man fights against his own people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟他们不是一伙的 - 那你为什么穿着他们的衣服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These aren't my people. - Then, why do you wear their colors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能告诉你 - 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't tell you that. - You need to tell us now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:22:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you that either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.30,0:23:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就杀了他 以防后患\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should kill him now and be done with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he dies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就无从得知他们是谁以及为何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know nothing about who they are and why they came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史蒂夫·特雷弗上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name is Captain Steve Trevor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行员 美国远征军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot, American Expeditionary Forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,编号8141921\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serial number 8141921.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的就是这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I ever need to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.95,0:23:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被派遣至英国情报机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assigned to British intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.59,0:23:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.34,0:23:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真言套索能让你说出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lasso of Hestia compels you to reveal the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.83,0:23:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可它为什么这么烫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's really hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.40,0:23:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗是毫无意义的 只会徒增痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is pointless and painful to resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在执行什么任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.62,0:23:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道现在自己的处境有多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you are, you are in more danger than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.41,0:23:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在执行什么任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.75,0:24:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.83,0:24:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是间谍 我是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a spy. I'm a spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.78,0:24:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国情报机构得到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}British intelligence got word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.25,0:24:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国陆军上将 鲁登道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the leader of the German Army Gen. Ludendorff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要前往奥斯曼帝国的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would be visiting a secret military installation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.52,0:24:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个秘密军事基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Ottoman empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伪装成德国飞行员与他们一同前往\N{\fnArial\fs30}I posed as one of their pilots and flew in with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.54,0:24:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据情报 德军已溃不成军\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to our intel, the Germans had no troops left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有资金 也没了军需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}No money, no munitions of any kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.42,0:24:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的情报是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our intel was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.68,0:24:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,德军让土耳其人为他们制造炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}The German had the Turks building bombs for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不光是炸药 还有新式武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not just bombs, new weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.12,0:24:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.15,0:24:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该武器是由鲁登道夫手下头号变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invented by Ludendorff's chief psychopath, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.52,0:24:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝尔·丸博士负责研发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Isabelle Maru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,前线士兵称她为「毒药博士」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boys in the trenches called her "Doctor Poison".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.66,0:25:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说不是没有道理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for good reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.69,0:25:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我的判断 如果丸博士研发成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I could tell if Dr. Maru was able to complete her work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.73,0:25:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上百万人会死去 战争就会永无休止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions more would die. The war would never end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务是暗中观察并汇报 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there to observe and report nothing more, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.25,0:25:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不得不采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I, I had to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.37,0:25:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我肯定能让毒气渗入面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can get the gas to pass through the mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.44,0:25:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 我还需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is, I need more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.14,0:25:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 博士 我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, Dr. We don't have more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.38,0:25:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这项研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}This work, this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.36,0:26:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.70,0:27:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能把这些笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get these notes back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.22,0:27:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,及时送到英国情报部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the British intelligence in time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.87,0:27:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能挽救数百万人的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could stop millions more from dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.61,0:27:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争就会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could stop the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.33,0:27:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争 什么战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}War? What war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.95,0:27:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}The War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,能结束一切的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war that end all wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.10,0:27:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,4年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.11,0:27:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,27个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}27 countries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.28,0:27:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,2500万人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}25 million dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.80,0:27:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵和平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers and civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.53,0:27:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜百姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.10,0:27:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妇女和儿童惨遭屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women and children slaughtered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的家园被洗劫 烧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their homes and villages looted and burned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.61,0:27:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所用的武器 残忍程度…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons far deadlier than you can…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.49,0:27:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.09,0:27:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我从未见到过的惨状\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like nothing I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.27,0:28:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿佛世界末日就要来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the world's gonna end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要放走他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we let him go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让他带更多的人来这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And risk him bringing more men to our shores?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.57,0:28:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能一直拘留他 女王大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can not hold him forever, my queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.62,0:28:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲 请听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.57,0:28:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男人说了那么多 这一定是阿瑞斯干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after everything the man said, this must be Ares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.92,0:28:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么 戴安娜 - 抱歉 参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about, Diana? - Forgive me, Senator, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.30,0:28:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那人说这是场无休止的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the man called it a war without end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.42,0:28:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有数百万人死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of people already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.10,0:28:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从未看过这种惨状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like nothing he's ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.53,0:28:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有阿瑞斯才能干出这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Ares could do such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能就这么放他走 我们要跟着他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can not simply let him go. We must go with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.12,0:28:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不会派我们的人去打他们的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not deploy our army and leave the scare defences{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.72,0:28:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着天堂岛无人镇守\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go and fight their war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他们的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not their war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.78,0:28:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯创造出来的人类是正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus created man to be just, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.43,0:28:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,智慧 强壮 富有激情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wise, strong and passionate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.13,0:28:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个故事 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a story, Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多事你还不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is much, you do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.21,0:28:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类很容易堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men are easily corrupted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.45,0:28:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但那一切都是阿瑞斯所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but Ares is behind that corruption!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.51,0:28:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿瑞斯怂恿德国人发动战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Ares who has these Germans fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.85,0:29:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止战争之神是我们的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stopping the God of war is our fore ordinance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.41,0:29:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为亚马逊人 这是我们的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Amazons this is our duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.20,0:29:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你跟我们这些亚马逊人不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not an Amazon like the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.99,0:29:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你什么都不要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you will do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.24,0:29:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为女王 我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your queen I forbid it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.52,0:29:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.45,0:29:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你救了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true you saved his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.94,0:29:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told you that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.45,0:29:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.21,0:29:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到你进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see you come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say you are a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.74,0:30:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们男人都长这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A typical example of your sex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.82,0:30:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.71,0:30:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要高于平均水准\N{\fnArial\fs30}above average.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.12,0:30:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.03,0:30:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.28,0:30:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是块手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.32,0:30:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}A watch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.38,0:30:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.72,0:30:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看时间用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tells time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.77,0:30:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲送给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father gave it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.64,0:30:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块表曾随他出生入死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went through hell back with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.50,0:30:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在到了我手里 还好它还在走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's for me. Good thing it's still ticking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.51,0:30:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉你时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it tells time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.46,0:30:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候该吃饭 睡觉 起床 工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}When to eat, sleep, wake up, work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.58,0:31:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让这个小东西指挥你做事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let this little thing tell you what to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.66,0:31:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,能问你几个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you some questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.60,0:31:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是哪里 - 天堂岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - Temiscira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.14,0:31:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过了 我是想问 这是哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got that before, but I mean. Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.91,0:31:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方 你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place? Who are you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.39,0:31:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么水是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does the water do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.69,0:31:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么连手表都没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you don't know what a watch is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.03,0:31:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么英语说得这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you speak English so well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.43,0:31:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会说几百种语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}We speak hundreds of languages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.31,0:31:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是促进人类和平共处的桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the bridge to a greater understanding between all men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.97,0:31:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.60,0:31:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有句话我还没来得及说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get a chance to say this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.02,0:31:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你把我从水里救了上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earlier, but thank you for dragging me out of the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.88,0:31:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海滩上帮我们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what you did on the beach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.00,0:32:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.37,0:32:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来放我走的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are here to let me go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.17,0:32:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了 但我说了不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, but it's not up to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.18,0:32:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至还让他们派我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even asked them to send me with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.52,0:32:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者亚马逊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.15,0:32:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,任意一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Amazon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.33,0:32:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚马逊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Amazons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.39,0:32:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚马逊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Amazons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护世界是我们的神圣使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our sacred duty to defend the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.48,0:32:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.75,0:32:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我母亲不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my mother will not allow it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.45,0:32:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say I blame her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.19,0:32:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战争的走向\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way this war's going…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.37,0:32:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想让我在乎的人靠近战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna let anyone I care about near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.06,0:32:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么想回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why do you want to go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.55,0:32:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没人「想」回到战场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think "want" is the word, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.85,0:32:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总得试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I got to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.19,0:32:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲曾经告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father told me once he said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.84,0:32:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「要是你发现这世界上有什么事不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If you see something wrong happening in the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.91,0:33:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么袖手旁观 要么有所作为「\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can either do nothing, or you can do something."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.70,0:33:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经袖手旁观过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I already tried nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.53,0:35:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一身不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.79,0:35:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.48,0:35:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你怎么离开岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'll show you the way off the Island, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我去找阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll take me to Ares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.74,0:35:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.70,0:36:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就坐它走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am leaving on that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.17,0:36:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.88,0:36:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就坐它走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're leaving in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.07,0:36:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开船吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not know how to sail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.73,0:36:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I know how to sail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.77,0:36:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会不知道 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I know how to sail? It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.72,0:36:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.53,0:36:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了 母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.73,0:36:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜的人不断死去 我不能坐视不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can not stand by while innocent lives are lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.80,0:36:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,若世上无人抵抗阿瑞斯 那我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If no one else will defend the world from Ares, then I must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.91,0:37:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.74,0:37:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.97,0:37:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我知道我拦不住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least I know I can not stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.04,0:37:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is so much…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.46,0:37:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多你不明白的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much you do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.95,0:37:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.95,0:37:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'm willing to fight for those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.46,0:37:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法保护自己的人而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}who cannot fight for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.18,0:37:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你曾经那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you once did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.30,0:37:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 如果你选择离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that if you choose to leave, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.94,0:37:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能就回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may never return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.16,0:37:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下来又有什么用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will I be if I stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.94,0:37:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这属于我们历史上最伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This belonged to the greatest warrior in our history, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.44,0:37:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们敬爱的安提俄珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}our beloved Antiope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.81,0:37:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证你配得上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you're worthy of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.84,0:37:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.45,0:38:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在人类的世界要小心 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful in the world of men, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.50,0:38:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不值得你去拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not deserve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.35,0:38:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been my greatest love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.45,0:38:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.69,0:38:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成了我最大的悲痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are my greatest sorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.62,0:39:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有告诉她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should you have told her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.83,0:39:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道得越多 他就会越快找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more she knows, the sooner he will find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.88,0:39:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有多久到战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until we reach the war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.88,0:39:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,战场 哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war, which part?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.23,0:39:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国西线战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Western Front in France is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.62,0:39:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,从阿尔卑斯山到北海 长达四百多英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}400 miles long, from the Alps to the North Sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.80,0:39:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去战斗最激烈的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fighting is the most intense then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.94,0:39:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我去 我肯定能找到阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you take me there, I'm sure I'll find Ares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.58,0:39:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争之神阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares as in the God of War?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.93,0:39:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他是我们的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God of war is our responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.39,0:39:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有亚马逊人能打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only an Amazon can defeat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.14,0:39:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.25,0:39:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once I do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争就会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}the war will end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.73,0:40:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的劲头我很欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate your spirit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.51,0:40:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this war is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.29,0:40:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a great big mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.64,0:40:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都没什么办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's not a whole lot you and I can do about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.48,0:40:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以回伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we can get back to London, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.98,0:40:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找能改变局势的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try to look for men who can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.47,0:40:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the man who can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.25,0:40:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我找到并打败阿瑞斯之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I find and destroy Ares, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.63,0:40:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,德军就能摆脱他的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}the German armies will be freed from his influence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.44,0:40:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会回归善良 世界会变好\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will good men again and the world will be better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.15,0:40:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.89,0:40:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.29,0:40:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.00,0:40:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe you wanna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.43,0:40:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}get some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.36,0:40:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢 你不睡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Are you not sleeping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.73,0:40:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般男人都不睡觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the average men not sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.14,0:40:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.61,0:40:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 睡 但是我们不和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we sleep. We just don't sleep with a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.96,0:40:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不和女人睡 - 不 我是说 也睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't sleep with women? - No, I mean, I do, I sleep with… I sleep with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.38,0:41:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和女人睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.74,0:41:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}But out of the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.46,0:41:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,结了婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}confines of marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.09,0:41:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.13,0:41:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,连想都不该想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not polite to assume, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.80,0:41:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「结婚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Marriage"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.42,0:41:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗 也对 你们也不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage! You haven't heard… Yeah, you don't have to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.58,0:41:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人走到神父面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go before a judge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.94,0:41:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,发誓要相爱 尊敬 珍惜彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you swear to love, honor and cherish each other, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.55,0:41:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到死亡将你们分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}until death do you apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.33,0:41:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会彼此相爱至死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do they love each other till death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.88,0:41:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不常有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not very often, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.57,0:41:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们为什么这么干呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why do they do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.00,0:41:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.17,0:41:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能跟我一起睡 除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can not sleep with me unless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.00,0:41:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想的话 我跟你睡 我在那睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sleep with you if you want. I'll sleep right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.38,0:41:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很大地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is plenty of room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.69,0:41:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 只要你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then fine, if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.72,0:41:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你说了算 - 我跟你睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's up to you. - I'll come and sleep with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.82,0:41:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.60,0:42:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那里 我不算是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I come from, I'm not considered average.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.98,0:42:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当间谍什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… Being a spy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.44,0:42:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要有一定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must show a certain amount of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.65,0:42:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}vigor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.12,0:42:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前没见过男人吗 你父亲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you never met a man before? What about your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.73,0:42:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.05,0:42:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲用泥土塑造了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother sculpted me from clay, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.75,0:42:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯赋予我生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was brought to life by Zeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.28,0:42:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那敢情好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that's neat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.18,0:42:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.09,0:42:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I come from, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.08,0:42:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子的诞生过程不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}babies are made differently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.30,0:43:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是生殖繁衍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You refer to reproductive biology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.30,0:43:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, yes. - Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.74,0:43:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.43,0:43:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指的是那个 还有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I refer to that and other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.25,0:43:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体的欢愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pleasures of the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.15,0:43:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.61,0:43:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,克利欧（历史之神）批评现世欢愉的十二卷我都读过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read all 12 volumes of Clio's criticism on earthly pleasures{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.00,0:43:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二卷呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}12?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.76,0:43:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没随身带上一两本吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you bring any of those with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.69,0:43:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would not enjoy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.83,0:43:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.61,0:43:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No you wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.95,0:43:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.29,0:43:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,书最后得出结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came to the conclusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.51,0:43:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要完成生殖过程必须有男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that man are essential for procreation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.61,0:43:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若是想要获得欢愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when it comes to pleasure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.85,0:43:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}unnecessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.02,0:43:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.34,0:43:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.35,0:43:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.17,0:44:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多久我们才能投入战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until we're operational?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.97,0:44:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.34,0:44:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚就行动 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have it up tonight, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.22,0:44:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 将士们没吃东西也没睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the men have had no food, no sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.43,0:44:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我吃了睡了吗 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I have had any food or rest, captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.16,0:44:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见我找借口了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me making excuses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.21,0:44:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.91,0:44:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手下软弱又自满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your men, they are weak and complacent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.97,0:44:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就忘了敌人随时都可能进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've let them forget for an attack can happen at any time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.75,0:44:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,从任何地方发起进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}from any corner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.40,0:44:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来提醒他们一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's you and I remind them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.89,0:44:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.55,0:44:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博士 - 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doctor. - General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.57,0:44:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Progress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.91,0:44:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is over, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国要投降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Germany is giving up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.88,0:44:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,冯·兴登堡已经建议皇帝签停战协约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Von Hindenburg has recommended the Kaiser sign the armistice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.21,0:44:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have run out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.82,0:45:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝一见到最新武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as the Kaiser sees the newest weapon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.42,0:45:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会签了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will not sign the armistice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.60,0:45:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但没有笔记本 - 我们会拿回你的笔记本的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But without my notebook… - We will get your book!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.40,0:45:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信的是你 不是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is you that I believe in, not it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.20,0:45:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的本事 你会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you can and will succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.09,0:45:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你天生就是干这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is what you're put on this earth to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.05,0:45:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚突发奇想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm seeing, it come to me last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.68,0:45:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一种气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}A different type of gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.40,0:45:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.02,0:45:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以强化你的体能\N{\fnArial\fs30}To restore your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.10,0:46:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have got it! I have got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.22,0:46:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它跟我想的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it's what I think, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.51,0:46:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将会\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's going to be, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.83,0:46:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.52,0:46:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.30,0:46:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很走运 有人带我们一程 省了不少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got lucky. We caught a ride, we make some good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.24,0:46:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到亲切的伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to jolly old London!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.71,0:46:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hideous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.52,0:46:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不是所有人都喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's not for everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.33,0:47:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 亲爱的 - 美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning darling. - What a babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.29,0:47:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.06,0:47:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 别乱看 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, eyes to yourself. Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.61,0:47:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.98,0:47:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么牵着手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they holding hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.72,0:47:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能因为他们在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably because they're together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.57,0:47:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们没在一起 不是一个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're not together, I mean, in that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.45,0:47:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.59,0:47:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.91,0:47:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 战场是那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, the war is that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.31,0:47:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得先走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we gotta get this way first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.56,0:47:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.41,0:47:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把笔记本交给上级\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get this notebook to my superiors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.33,0:47:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我放你走 你带我去找阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I let you go. You take me to Ares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.68,0:47:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们说好的 史蒂夫·特雷弗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We made a deal, Steve Trevor. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.68,0:47:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好了就是保证了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a deal is a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.32,0:47:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证过就不能食言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know promises are unbreakable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.27,0:47:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 该死 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy! Damn it, alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.29,0:47:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先跟我来 我们把它送过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me first to deliver this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.20,0:47:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后给你买张票\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll give you a ticket, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.72,0:47:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.97,0:48:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.46,0:48:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.45,0:48:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么做 因为你没穿衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can not do that because you're not wearing any clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.12,0:48:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去买衣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go… Let's go buy some clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.53,0:48:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些女人打仗时穿什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do these women wear into battle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.44,0:48:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们不\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.44,0:48:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.05,0:48:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别碰小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.96,0:48:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别摸他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.34,0:48:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是泥土做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not made out of clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.37,0:48:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.62,0:48:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana! Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.09,0:48:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 你没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God! You're not dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.02,0:48:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurray!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.90,0:48:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到你电话之前我真以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did think you're dead till I got your call, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.69,0:48:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他消失了好几个星期 一点消息都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been gone for weeks. Not a single word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.14,0:48:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不像他的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very unlike him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.40,0:48:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自我介绍一下 我叫埃塔·坎蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am introducing myself. I'm Etta Candy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.94,0:48:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史蒂夫·特雷弗的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Steve Trevor's secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.05,0:48:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘书是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is a secretary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.76,0:49:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我去哪我就去哪 让我干什么我就干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go where he tells me to go and I do what he tells me to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.57,0:49:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那儿 这叫奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I am from, that's called slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.29,0:49:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.41,0:49:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真棒 女士们先请 - 我真喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fantastic. Ladies after you. - Oh I do, I like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.58,0:49:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实跟奴隶差不多 但我们薪水还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did that's all feel like that, except the pay is rather good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.19,0:49:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是另外一种体力劳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've bought our work. For a second way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.55,0:49:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们国家的铠甲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what passes armor in your country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.22,0:49:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铠甲 - 是时尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Armors". - It's fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.57,0:49:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能收紧小肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps our tummies in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.58,0:49:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要收紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why must you keep them in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.01,0:49:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有小肚子的女人才会这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any woman without tummy would ask that question!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.86,0:49:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,保守 但又不失趣味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conservative, but not entirely unfun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.46,0:49:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码穿上试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it on at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.28,0:49:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.60,0:49:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.12,0:49:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.42,0:50:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人穿着这个怎么打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can a woman possibly fight in this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.35,0:50:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.42,0:50:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有我们的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use our principles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.29,0:50:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能争取到投票权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's how we are gonna get the vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.26,0:50:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我也不反对动用一点武力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I am not opposed to engaging in a bitter fist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.94,0:50:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在迫不得已的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}should the occasion arise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.28,0:50:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.09,0:50:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痒 我喘不上气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's itching. It's choking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正总有人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can they blame it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.19,0:50:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Etta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.76,0:50:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.69,0:50:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在试第226件\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's trying out number 226.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.67,0:50:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎蒂女士 目的是让她别那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Candy, the whole point was to make her look less{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,显眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}distracting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.60,0:50:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.38,0:50:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Specs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.58,0:50:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为戴上它就不是你见过的最美的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly she's not the most beautiful woman you've ever seen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.62,0:51:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.99,0:51:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, that's not gonna work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.41,0:51:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把剑放下 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please put the sword down, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.33,0:51:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.53,0:51:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.93,0:51:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.64,0:51:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Etta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.90,0:51:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在办公室等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I meet you back at the office?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.60,0:51:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个交给我保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}And meanwhile, I'll take this for safekeeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.48,0:51:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.53,0:51:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把剑放下 戴安娜 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta put the sword down, Diana. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.38,0:51:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟你这一身不搭 - 一点都不搭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't go with the outfit. - Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.33,0:51:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把剑放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the sword down, first of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.30,0:51:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 你会用生命保护它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you'll protect it with your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.47,0:51:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 才不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.41,0:51:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以相信她 给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust her. Just hand that over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.71,0:51:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盾牌 - 盾牌也给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shield. - And the shield to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.84,0:51:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好了吗 谢谢 埃塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it? Thanks, Etta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.90,0:52:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.44,0:52:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.42,0:52:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.57,0:52:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望没事 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully, nothing. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.96,0:52:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史蒂夫 我们在躲什么 - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steve, why are we hiding? - Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.17,0:53:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷弗上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.41,0:53:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你身上肯定藏着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you have something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.68,0:53:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁登道夫将军的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is the property of Gen. Ludendorff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.46,0:53:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏蛋的惯用口吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bad guy convention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.61,0:53:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把丸博士的笔记本交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us Dr. Maru's note book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.21,0:53:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它放哪来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I put that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.72,0:53:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.97,0:53:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不还是你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.00,0:53:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.31,0:53:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么没展示给我看的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else you wanna show me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.93,0:53:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.66,0:54:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但你显然是被阿瑞斯控制了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but you're clearly under Ares' control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.85,0:54:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴安娜 - 让我来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diana. - Let me help you get free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.57,0:54:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瑞斯在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will I find Ares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.35,0:54:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's… he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.46,0:54:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,氰化物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyanide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.57,0:54:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着别动 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here. I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.38,0:54:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Gentlemen, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.39,0:54:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.13,0:54:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes thank you, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.83,0:54:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国这个国家无比傲慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Germany is an immensely proud nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.25,0:54:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会投降的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will never surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.40,0:54:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,想结束这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look. The only way to end this war…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.26,0:54:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 借一步说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, I need to talk to you outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.10,0:55:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世界重获和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}and restore world peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.05,0:55:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的办法就是谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is to negotiate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.50,0:55:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,签停战协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}an armistice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.74,0:55:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.18,0:55:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这干什么 让她出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she doing here? Get her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.66,0:55:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ger her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.48,0:55:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.57,0:55:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是盲人 迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blind sister, she got lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.26,0:55:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's right there I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.04,0:55:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼下我们唯一的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only aim at this time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.17,0:55:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}must be to achieve peace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.02,0:55:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,争取和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}at any cost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.46,0:55:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不听他讲话 他在谈论和平 - 不是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why you been not hearing speech? He is talking of peace. - Not right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.12,0:55:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷弗 你到底在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor, what the hell were you thinking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.77,0:55:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 居然把女人带到这里来 - 我带回来的情报时间非常紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- bringing a woman into the counsel? - The intel that I brought back is time sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.17,0:55:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一本丸博士的笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one of Dr. Maru's notebooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.01,0:55:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 管它是什么本 - 我们得把它送去解密\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Notebook or notes… - We need to get it to Cryptography.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.90,0:55:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我需要立刻和各位将军汇报这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need a immediate audience with the generals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.88,0:55:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能随意闯进这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not just barge in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.56,0:55:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校请恕我直言 我所看到的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir with all due respect. What I saw in my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.82,0:55:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 将会改变这场战争的走向 - 特雷弗上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will change the course of war. - Captain Trevor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.08,0:56:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说在一次行动中失去了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard we lost you in one of your mission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.93,0:56:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你是死里逃生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and here you are, back from the dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.60,0:56:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还带来了一位朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I see you brought a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.99,0:56:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对冒昧闯入的行为深感抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My deepest apology for interruption sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.35,0:56:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无须道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, non sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.01,0:56:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢这位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to this young woman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.89,0:56:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间终于能安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the room was finally quiet enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.53,0:56:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我讲几句话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to get a few words in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.70,0:56:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是帕特里克·摩根 乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Patrick Morgan, at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.21,0:56:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 我是天堂岛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, princess of the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.27,0:56:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,普林斯 她叫戴安娜·普林斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Prince". Diana Prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.88,0:56:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.22,0:56:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.42,0:56:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.61,0:56:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.65,0:56:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她帮助我带回了这本笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}She actually helped me bring this notebook back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.71,0:56:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笔记来自丸博士的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}That through Dr. Maru's lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.46,0:56:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想里面写的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the information it contains inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.02,0:56:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会改变这场战争的走向\N{\fnArial\fs30}will change the course of the war, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.20,0:56:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.88,0:56:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毒药博士的吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. Poison herself. - Yes, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.39,0:57:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.89,0:57:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intriguing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.41,0:57:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么别的情报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any further intelligence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.87,0:57:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 解密部门没破解出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly not, sir. Cryptography had no luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.84,0:57:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笔记像是由两种语言组成\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like it's a mixture of two languages, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.36,0:57:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们并未解出是哪两种语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as if they failed to determine which two languages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.94,0:57:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,土耳其语和苏美尔语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ottoman and Sumerian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.76,0:57:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房间里肯定有其他人也知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely someone else in this room knew that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.56,0:57:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.62,0:57:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.30,0:57:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secretary, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.91,0:57:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她懂土耳其语和苏美尔语\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she can understand Ottoman and Sumerian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.47,0:57:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是位能力出众的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a very good secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.46,0:57:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这位女士能看懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, if this woman can read it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.14,0:57:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得听听看她怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should hear what she has to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.25,0:57:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就听吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.96,0:57:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个配方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a formula, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.12,0:57:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种新型气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a new kind of gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.47,0:58:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,芥子气 用氢取代了硫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mustard gas, hydrogen based instead of sulfur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.87,0:58:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,用氢取代了硫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydrogen based…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.21,0:58:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,防毒面具挡不住氢基气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas masks will be useless against hydrogen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.00,0:58:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,笔记上说他们计划在前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book says, they plan to release the gas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.79,0:58:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放这种气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the front?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.57,0:58:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.45,0:58:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.21,0:58:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 什么前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. In "front" of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.72,0:58:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.09,0:58:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要找的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is the evidence we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.63,0:58:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,得找到她们在哪里制造这种气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to find out where they are making that gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.35,0:58:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后将这种气体燃烧殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to burn it to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.05,0:58:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.86,0:58:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁登道夫最近一次出现是在比利时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ludendorff was last seen in Belgium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.72,0:58:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能明目张胆地把军队派去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be seen in sending troops{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.73,0:58:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,被德国占领的比利时\N{\fnArial\fs30}into German-occupied Belgium, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.86,0:58:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是他们打算投降的节骨眼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we are negotiating their surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.98,0:58:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到过这种气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I have seen that gas with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.01,0:58:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦它被使用 两边的人都会被杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is used, it will kill everyone on both sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.81,0:58:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will all die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.92,0:58:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这就是士兵的职责 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's what soldiers do, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.49,0:58:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,派我去 只需要给我一些后勤上的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me in with some logistical support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.67,0:58:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少给我一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least give me the chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.01,0:58:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去摧毁鲁登道夫的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take out Ludendorff's operation myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.84,0:58:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.28,0:58:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这个节骨眼上可不想节外生枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't introduce rogue elements this late in the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.62,0:58:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I can take…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.48,0:58:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now more than ever, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.15,0:58:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,停战协定才是最重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}the armistice is off paramount importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.89,0:58:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要谈判 协定必须被签署\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be negotiated it must be signed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.45,0:59:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是停止战争最好的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the best way of stopping the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.25,0:59:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 你什么都不许做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, you will do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.55,0:59:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.45,0:59:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.70,0:59:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.58,0:59:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.94,0:59:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 我知道这令人困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, I know this is confusing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.18,0:59:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不困惑 简直不可理喻 - 这个女人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is not confusing! It's unthinkable! - Who is this woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.25,0:59:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和我一起的 她站在我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is with me, she is with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.04,0:59:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是和你一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.32,0:59:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在知情的情况下牺牲那么多的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would knowingly sacrifice all those lives, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.08,0:59:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他们的命没有你值钱似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}as if they mean less than yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.42,0:59:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴安娜 我们出去说 - 就像他们无足轻重\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diana, let's talk about it outside. - As if they mean nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.51,0:59:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的家乡 将军才不会像懦夫一样躲在办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I come from, generals don't hide in their offices like cowards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.94,0:59:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 - 他们和士兵并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's enough! - They fight alongside their soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.32,0:59:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们和士兵在战场上出生入死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They die with them on the battlefield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.81,0:59:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 抱歉 - 你应该感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's enough! My apologies. - You should be ashamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.53,0:59:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 你应该感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My apologies. - You should be ashamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.82,0:59:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴安娜 - 你们都应该感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diana… - All of you should be ashamed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.38,0:59:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请慢一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please slow down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.88,0:59:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your leader?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.58,0:59:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么能这么说 你能相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he say that? Believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.98,0:59:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.52,0:59:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的工作就只是把那本笔记给他们吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was your duty to simply give them a book? - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.89,0:59:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有坚持你的立场 你没有反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't stand your ground. You didn't fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.92,0:59:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们没有办法改变任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there was no chance of changing anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.66,0:59:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是阿瑞斯 他是绝不可能谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Ares. It's not going to allow negotiation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.80,0:59:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不可能投降的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor a surrender!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.18,1:00:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾说上百万民众都会因此丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The millions of people you talked about, they will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.90,1:00:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going anyway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.94,1:00:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你在说谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you were lying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.00,1:00:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个间谍 这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a spy! That's what I do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.42,1:00:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你现在不是在跟我说谎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you're not lying to me right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.87,1:00:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你去前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you to the front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.07,1:00:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们极有可能会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are probably gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.91,1:00:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个糟糕的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a terrible idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.60,1:00:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找些帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need reinforcements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.07,1:00:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人就是帮手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the reinforcements?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.00,1:00:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.42,1:00:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定他们是好人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these even good men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.45,1:00:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,相对而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, relatively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.61,1:00:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是在非洲也没见过这样富到流油的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in Africa gentlemen, we haven't seen such luxuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.52,1:00:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而到了我们手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The luxury that we have now is like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.32,1:00:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是赚钱赚到手软\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't stop making money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.77,1:00:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我叔 还有一位王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my uncle, the Prince, and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.46,1:01:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 哪位王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, which prince is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.94,1:01:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定宽恕你的不敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to extend your profanity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.92,1:01:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 哪位王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But seriously, which prince?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.73,1:01:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏丹的 安哥拉的还是哪个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sultan, Angora, Next Kashmir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.31,1:01:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能借一步说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Can we talk for a minute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.97,1:01:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 恕我失陪一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, excuse me one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.70,1:01:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里是酒馆 - 你这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A bar… Well, a pub. - You buck…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.33,1:01:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟这帮家伙吹牛皮呢 你来干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been racing those peacock all night, and you've…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.14,1:01:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my goodness, gracious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.90,1:01:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是艺术品\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a work of art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.05,1:01:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨米尔 这是戴安娜 戴安娜 这是萨米尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sameer, Diana. Diana, Sameer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.95,1:01:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好戴安娜 请叫我萨米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Diana. You can call me Sammy please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.05,1:01:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「萨米」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sammy".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.27,1:01:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨米尔 我奉劝你别那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sameer, I wouldn't… do that if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.61,1:01:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨米尔是顶尖的卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sameer is a top undercover man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.98,1:01:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他巧舌如簧 也跟你一样会说多种语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can talk the skin off a cabbage many ways as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.62,1:01:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们终于结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.66,1:01:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.79,1:02:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voila!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.88,1:02:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少这个查理拳头还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least this Charlie is good with his fists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.22,1:02:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.33,1:02:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.70,1:02:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.05,1:02:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May god grow a flower upon your head son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.89,1:02:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.67,1:02:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚为什么打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what were you fighting about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.73,1:02:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不小心拿错了他的杯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mistook his glass for mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.71,1:02:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,失误在所难免\N{\fnArial\fs30}That happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.54,1:02:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人根本不是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man is no fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.02,1:02:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理是个专业的狙击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie is an expert marksman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.94,1:02:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是他打枪很准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means he shoots people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.01,1:02:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,从远距离射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}From very far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.53,1:02:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都不知道怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know what hit 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.10,1:02:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不到他们的脸怎么知道自己打的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know who you kill if you can't see their face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.87,1:02:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这反而更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't. Trust me it's better that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.17,1:02:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的战斗毫无荣誉可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight without honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.97,1:02:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁给我的荣誉买单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gets paid for honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.05,1:02:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这次是什么工作 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the job, boss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.03,1:03:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days tops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.24,1:03:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要准备物资还有通行证前往比利时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need supplies and access to Belgium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.77,1:03:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟下来多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the going rate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.00,1:03:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是个好价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better be a good pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.04,1:03:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, here's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.10,1:03:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟行程很短\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it will be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.30,1:03:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你会收获很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's a lot to be gained by this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.58,1:03:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了崇高的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for a great cause, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.51,1:03:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}freedom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.20,1:03:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,友谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}friendship, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.93,1:03:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束战争 友谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}ending the war, friendship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.08,1:03:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你没钱 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, You have no money. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.86,1:03:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.85,1:03:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.52,1:03:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将把她送到前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna drop her up front!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.77,1:03:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送她去 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Dropping her off"? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.05,1:03:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 我才不会为了救其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question sweetheart, I am not gonna get myself killed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.34,1:03:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就牺牲我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}helping every last human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.41,1:03:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我拒绝 - 原来你这小偷在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's No, I mean. - Here's the little thief now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.10,1:04:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既害怕又兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am both frightened and aroused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.70,1:04:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在这儿 抱歉我来迟了 - 帕特里克长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh here they are! Sorry I'm late. - Sir Patrick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.00,1:04:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚想和你们说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's what I was gonna mention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.34,1:04:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里克长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Patrick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.30,1:04:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧 先生们 普林斯小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Gentlemen, sit. Ms. Prince, sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.00,1:04:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你们在谋划什么事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you are here planning something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.21,1:04:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事会让你们上军事法庭 或是没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's going to get you either court martial or killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.24,1:04:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 你是来阻止我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume, you are here to stop us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.89,1:04:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.49,1:04:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.04,1:04:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.97,1:04:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾经是个年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was an younger man once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.59,1:04:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果身体够硬朗 我也会做一样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had I been in better health, and I might do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.87,1:04:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做的事情非常光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very very honorable thing you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.52,1:04:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.74,1:04:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.70,1:04:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是私下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unofficially, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.18,1:04:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.80,1:04:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还有别的武器厂 找到一个毁一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's another weapon's facility, find it and destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.46,1:04:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有对付鲁登道夫和丸博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with Ludendorff and Maru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.66,1:05:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样 为了避免怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, to allay suspicion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.95,1:05:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的埃塔女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}our charming Etta{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.43,1:05:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以在我的办公室指挥这次行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}could run the mission from my office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.67,1:05:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「指挥」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Run"…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.72,1:05:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.76,1:05:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些应该够用几天的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is enough here for a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.85,1:05:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.23,1:05:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.31,1:05:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们多多保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take great care all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.93,1:05:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.52,1:05:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Health!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.48,1:05:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,新鲜的冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh ice-cream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.28,1:05:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 想来个冰淇淋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, would you like to buy an ice cream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.44,1:05:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我吗 - 你饿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - You hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.05,1:05:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.63,1:05:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.55,1:05:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,八便士 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight pence please, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.01,1:06:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 不用找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, keep the change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.29,1:06:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.78,1:06:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛 - 太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you doing? - It's wonderful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.64,1:06:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该感到非常骄傲 - 谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should be very proud. - Thank you very much!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.05,1:06:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该感到非常骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be very proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.95,1:06:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很长很长的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a long way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.33,1:06:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很长的路要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way to go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.93,1:06:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想在这摆个小摊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I got niches here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.28,1:06:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长还指望着我们天黑前能到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief's expecting us before dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.97,1:06:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.09,1:06:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个走私犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah. A smuggler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.51,1:06:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very reputable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.33,1:06:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子 杀手 又来个走私犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A liar, a murderer, and now a smuggler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.94,1:06:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.48,1:06:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 我要伤心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, I might get offended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.73,1:06:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't referring to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.92,1:06:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.10,1:06:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了卧底假装别人的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna recover from pretending to be somebody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.12,1:06:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在海滩上打死人 还偷笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot people on your beach and stolen a notebook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.04,1:06:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子 杀手和走私犯 你还跟我走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A liar, murderer and smuggler. You still coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.26,1:07:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.78,1:07:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们在这儿的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.20,1:07:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种气体真要人命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas will kill everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.29,1:07:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的武器才会让无辜的人受害\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind weapons kills innocents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.45,1:07:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这场战争里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this war, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.05,1:07:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一种都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}every kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.01,1:07:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没出席会议 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were absent at the counsel meeting, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.40,1:07:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你背着我在谈停战协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you are negotiating the terms armistice without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.40,1:07:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 代表皇帝 - 是你坚持的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the Kaiser's behalf. - On your insistence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.71,1:07:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕有点信心 我们都能轻松赢得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could easily win this war if only you had a little faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.94,1:07:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.44,1:07:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物短缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are shortages of food, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.47,1:08:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,药物和弹药都不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}meds and ammunition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.30,1:08:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每耽误一刻 就有上千德国人牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hour we delay costs thousands of German lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.10,1:08:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要再发动一次攻击 世界就是我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One attack and the world could be ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.42,1:08:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的化学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we speak, my chemistry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.32,1:08:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们反对你和你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stand against you and your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.93,1:08:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.56,1:08:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁登道夫 够了 再过24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ludendorff, enough! 24 hours from now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.70,1:08:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战争就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this war will end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.42,1:08:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.16,1:08:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说是结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.32,1:08:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们来说都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is over for all of you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.82,1:08:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是防毒面具是没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the mask won't help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.36,1:08:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.90,1:09:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.77,1:09:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候给皇帝展示展示了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to stage a demonstration to the Kaiser!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.12,1:09:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.14,1:09:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了躲避偷袭 酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avoid sneak attack, chief!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.60,1:09:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.50,1:09:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to see you pal. - Big mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.90,1:09:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to see you. - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.47,1:09:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.89,1:09:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yaa beauty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.60,1:09:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.01,1:09:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.83,1:09:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.06,1:09:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.67,1:09:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从海里捡到他的 - 这是个很长的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I plucked him from the sea. - Well. It's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.97,1:09:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用现在讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to talk about that right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.61,1:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.30,1:09:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给德国人的英国茶叶\N{\fnArial\fs30}British tea from the Germans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.53,1:09:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给英国人的德国啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}German beer for the British.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.37,1:10:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给两边的埃德加·赖斯·巴勒斯的小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Edgar Rice Burroughs novels for both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.96,1:10:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我们得到自己想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. May we get what we want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.62,1:10:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我们得到自己需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we get what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.41,1:10:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我们永不会罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But may we never get what we deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.89,1:10:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪的雷声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.80,1:10:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国野战炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}German 77's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.68,1:10:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当于一支大枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns big ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.13,1:10:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边就是前线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the front out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.88,1:10:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像傍晚的浓雾 - 所以你为了什么而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The evening haze. - So, who do you fight for in this war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.83,1:10:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.32,1:10:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是来这边做生意的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here for profits then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.72,1:10:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没别的地方待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No better place to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.54,1:10:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就来到了战场上 还不效忠任何一边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere better to be than in a war where you don't take a side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.37,1:10:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无处可归\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no where else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.92,1:10:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次战争夺去了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last war took everything from my people. We have nothing left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.97,1:10:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.76,1:10:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是自由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.90,1:10:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁夺走了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who took that from your people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.45,1:10:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}His people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.48,1:11:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.40,1:11:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过去 别过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go in there. Do not go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.90,1:11:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 别过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not! Guys, No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.96,1:11:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.42,1:11:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.84,1:11:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没事了 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safe. Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.74,1:11:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你个婆娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you woman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.09,1:11:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,少大惊小怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop making a fuss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.21,1:11:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.52,1:11:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撞鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.88,1:11:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会着凉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're gonna get cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.89,1:11:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.54,1:11:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意查理说的话 他不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about Charlie. He doesn't mean any, alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.14,1:11:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要伤害动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}These animals, why are they hurting them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.64,1:11:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们跟我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they need to move quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.69,1:12:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要赶路 - 但这么做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like us! - But this is not the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.09,1:12:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮助他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.21,1:12:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no time. Come on, woman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.22,1:12:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.01,1:12:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man, he's wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.28,1:12:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不了什么忙的 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing you can do about it, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.50,1:12:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.19,1:12:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.25,1:12:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你让我带你来的战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me to take you to war. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.40,1:12:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,德军在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where are the Germans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.38,1:12:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这片无人区几百码开外的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of 100 yards across the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.41,1:12:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们的战壕 - 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The trench is… - Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.70,1:12:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长 能见到您太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief! Oh it's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.06,1:12:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长回来了 他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, chief's back! He's back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.28,1:12:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 动身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.67,1:13:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, we have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.73,1:13:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得帮助这些人 - 任务为重\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to help these people. - We have to stay on mission!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.29,1:13:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个据点至少还有一天的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next safe crossing is at least a day away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.14,1:13:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,磨磨蹭蹭干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.22,1:13:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can not leave without helping them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.70,1:13:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能坐视不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.69,1:13:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物短缺 村民被奴役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to eat and in the village enslaved it there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.17,1:13:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我理解你的心情 - 妇女和孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I understand that. - Women and children!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.61,1:13:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶在日落前到达下一个据点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to make our next position by sunset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.28,1:13:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能这么说 你到底是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say that? What is the matter with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.84,1:13:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是无人区 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is No Man's Land! Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.60,1:13:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着没人能活着走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means no man can cross it, alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.60,1:13:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,军营在这里驻扎快一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This battalion has been here for nearly a year, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.12,1:13:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,连一寸地都没攻下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they barely gained an inch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.53,1:13:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在另一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright? Because on the other side, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.08,1:13:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群德国人正端着机枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are a bunch of Germans pointing machine guns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.46,1:13:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准这里每一寸土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}at every square inch of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.05,1:13:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不可能穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not something you can cross. This is not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.64,1:13:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 我们见死不救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? So we do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.77,1:13:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们在救 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we are doing something. We are, we just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.11,1:13:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史蒂夫 - 我们救不了战争里的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steve. - We can't save everyone in this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.09,1:13:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve, Steve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.45,1:14:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not what we came here to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.88,1:14:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.80,1:14:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's what I'm going to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.07,1:14:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.58,1:15:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈演的是哪一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the bloody hell she's playing at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.75,1:15:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage, fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.41,1:15:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她挡住了所有的火力 快冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's taking all the fire! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.18,1:15:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down! Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.67,1:15:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.83,1:16:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.90,1:16:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做到了 冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done it! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.98,1:16:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.24,1:16:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.98,1:16:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.10,1:17:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着别动 我先过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here, I'll go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.46,1:17:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这他妈… - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the… - Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.19,1:18:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来点火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more firepower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.09,1:19:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,狙击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sniper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.22,1:19:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.59,1:19:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.47,1:19:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 在钟楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, bell tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.28,1:20:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 查理 开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Charlie. Shoot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.27,1:20:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.66,1:20:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. Give me some cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.44,1:20:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.49,1:20:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个扛在背上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna put this on our back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.22,1:20:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说举 就立刻举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I say go, lift hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.36,1:20:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.74,1:20:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 盾牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana! Shield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.70,1:20:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,举\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.78,1:21:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,站稳不要动 朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay very very still, for me my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.16,1:21:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. It's so important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.54,1:21:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太谢谢你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.85,1:21:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,能为你们拍照真是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has been such an honor for me taking you photograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.87,1:21:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.20,1:21:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴上说了那么久开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all his talk of shooting, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.74,1:21:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实不会用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}he cannot shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.32,1:22:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每个人都能成为自己理想的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone gets to be where they want to be all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.25,1:22:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I'm an actor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.86,1:22:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,热爱表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love acting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.53,1:22:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想当士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to be a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.44,1:22:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可惜我生错了肤色\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm the wrong color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.80,1:22:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都有自己的仗要打 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's fighting their own battle, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.56,1:22:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you're fighting yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.26,1:22:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多了 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too much. I wish you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.05,1:22:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.91,1:22:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm on the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.30,1:22:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是费尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "Veld", V-E-L-D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.05,1:22:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个小村庄\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tiny village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.76,1:22:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图上可能找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not even be on the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.71,1:22:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.30,1:22:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到鲁登道夫的实验室了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find Ludendorff's operation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.20,1:22:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 但我能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, but I located him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.07,1:22:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你运气真好 他离你只有几里路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And oh, lucky you, he's only a few miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.77,1:22:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在德军最高指挥部\N{\fnArial\fs30}At German High Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.99,1:22:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,德军最高指挥部\N{\fnArial\fs30}The German High Command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.86,1:22:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to intel report, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.66,1:22:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁登道夫在举办宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ludendorff is hosting a gala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.23,1:22:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是德军签署停战协定前最后的狂欢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of a last hara before the Germans sign the armistice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.97,1:23:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝本人也会出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the Kaiser himself is going to be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.40,1:23:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有丸博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}As well as Dr. Maru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.45,1:23:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宴会大概就是个幌子 - 特雷弗上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually the Gala could be perfect cover. - Captain Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.09,1:23:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.83,1:23:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚你决不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under no circumstances to go anywhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.50,1:23:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那个宴会 听见我的话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}near that gala tomorrow night. Do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.69,1:23:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然之前的努力就全白费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be jeopardizing everything we've worked for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.01,1:23:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能妨碍协定的签署\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can not compromise the armistice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.68,1:23:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 德军一旦攻破前线 - 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, there will be no armistice… - Steve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.14,1:23:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,停战协定也无从谈起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}once Ludendorff bombs the entire front line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.17,1:23:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等我一下 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on one second, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.40,1:23:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用担心停战协定的签署\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't be bothered about setting the peace agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.60,1:23:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 阿瑞斯绝不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Ares would never let…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.08,1:23:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.40,1:23:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.68,1:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 这才说得通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, it makes complete sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.47,1:23:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瑞斯打造了一件终极武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares developed a weapon, the worst ever devised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.65,1:23:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说的是鲁登道夫吧 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ares? You mean Ludendorff. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.98,1:23:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的就是阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean Ares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.94,1:23:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁登道夫就是阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ludendorff is Ares!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.99,1:23:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这是我们最后的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this is our last chance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.85,1:23:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有找到毒气藏在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}our final chance to find out where the gas is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.75,1:23:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能搞清楚鲁登道夫打算投放在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to learn how Ludendorff plans on delivering it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.09,1:23:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不许\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I forbid it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.97,1:23:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me? I forbid it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.28,1:23:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我这里信号不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I am losing you! Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.23,1:23:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Sir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.46,1:24:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有多大几率会听我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How likely is he to respect my wishes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.30,1:24:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,约等于零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not very like, I'm convinced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.14,1:24:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨米 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, Sammy, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.56,1:24:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I have to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.04,1:24:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了明天的宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta rustle up with a German uniform{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.93,1:24:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得搞一套德军军服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took to plot the course tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.34,1:24:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不简单 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy, boss. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.77,1:24:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正天亮前我们也做不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do till tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.22,1:24:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说的 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said yourself, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.53,1:24:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢您 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.14,1:24:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.60,1:24:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.43,1:24:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前在天堂岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have dancing on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.83,1:25:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳过舞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paradise Island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.69,1:25:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然跳过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dancing, yeah of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.09,1:25:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人就是摇来摇去而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are just… swaying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.17,1:25:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到你要对抗的是战争之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if you're gonna be fighting the God of war, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.58,1:25:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就勉为其难地教教你跳舞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might as well teach you how to dance, you poor thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.93,1:25:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪是不需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, probably without the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.75,1:25:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,赏脸跳个舞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.04,1:25:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.72,1:25:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去宴会的话 我得学学你们的舞蹈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm going to a Gala, I'll need to know how to dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.01,1:25:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能去宴会 - 我当然要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You aren't going to the Gala. - Of course I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.55,1:25:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Why wouldn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.01,1:25:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你不会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for one, you don't know how to dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.47,1:25:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还可以说他们不会跳舞呢 - 虚心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would argue with this, they don't know how to dance. - Be polite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.04,1:25:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.60,1:25:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.35,1:25:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll put my arm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.75,1:25:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,搂着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}around you like so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.42,1:25:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.40,1:25:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫什么 摇来摇去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you call? Sway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.94,1:25:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就摇来摇去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just sway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.77,1:25:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你靠得太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awfully close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.36,1:26:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是跳舞的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's this all about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.39,1:26:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.61,1:26:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好些年没听他唱歌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't heard him sing in years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.07,1:26:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫下雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a snowfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.32,1:26:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰碰看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.64,1:26:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's magical!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.06,1:26:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.92,1:26:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.85,1:27:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有战争的时候 人们都这样生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what people do when there are no wars to fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.13,1:27:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.29,1:27:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会做些别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this… and other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.38,1:27:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.39,1:27:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.53,1:27:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们可喜欢吃早餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They really love a breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.20,1:27:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有起床之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they love to wake up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.82,1:27:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看报纸 然后去上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}read the paper and go to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.16,1:27:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后还会结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.34,1:27:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,生个小孩然后白头偕老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes some babies and grow old together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.09,1:27:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.05,1:27:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.58,1:27:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.97,1:29:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,村民们送的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}The villagers gave them to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.20,1:29:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 馈赠啊 - 他们还称我们为英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A gracious gift. - And they call us heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.13,1:29:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.12,1:29:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fellas, I know that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.77,1:29:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过这是两天的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said this job was 2 day's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.47,1:29:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在两天到了 说话算话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a deal is a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.08,1:29:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我们你撑不过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't last without us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.66,1:29:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.64,1:29:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜倒是能保护好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know Diana is capable of taking care of herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.47,1:29:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried that you won't make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.07,1:29:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有赏金了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.96,1:29:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been paid enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.69,1:29:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了我你们更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be better off without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.00,1:29:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.09,1:29:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁唱歌给我们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will sing for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.87,1:30:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 这就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Oh no, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.77,1:30:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.08,1:30:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.00,1:30:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,芦苇苍苍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reeds are green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.68,1:30:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿野莽莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reeds are green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.40,1:30:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生命中最美妙的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sweetest hours I could live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.73,1:30:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当我是小孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must think I was born yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.27,1:30:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很疯狂 但是是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds crazy, but it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.31,1:30:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.00,1:30:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.56,1:30:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说一座岛上全是像她一样的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a whole island of women like her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.41,1:30:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一个男的也没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not a single man among them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.47,1:30:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.68,1:30:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she thinks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.54,1:30:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁登道夫就是战争之神阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that Ludendorff is Ares, the god of war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.40,1:30:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有杀了他才能结束战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only by killing him will the war end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.05,1:30:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,少唬我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be daft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.25,1:30:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你当时都看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what happened out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.25,1:30:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫发无伤地端掉重机枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way she dropped that machine gun nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.45,1:30:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻下了那座钟楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way she took out the tower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.85,1:30:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定是真的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}May be it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.22,1:30:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.13,1:30:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也相信是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.44,1:30:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 你该不会也相信这些瞎扯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven son, you don't really believe those rubbish thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.44,1:31:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 注意隐蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, Diana, hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.66,1:31:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要怎么才能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell do we get into that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.18,1:31:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,门口的几个守卫很好引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see only a couple of guards in the door to distract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.96,1:31:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我这么大摇大摆过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it won't look suspicious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.30,1:31:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去真的一点也不可疑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I wanna come sauntering out of the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.06,1:31:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.21,1:31:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not going in there, it's too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.06,1:31:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太危险？- 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Too dangerous? - Yes, too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.60,1:31:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你这一身太招摇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are too distracting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.90,1:31:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go in there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.42,1:31:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能顺藤摸瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}follow them to find where they are working on the gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.80,1:31:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到毒气厂的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or better yet, where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.33,1:31:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你一起去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm coming with you. - No, you are not coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.13,1:31:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服不适合当卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're wearing isn't exactly undercover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.72,1:31:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.44,1:31:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很适合在宴会里边当卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say she was pretty undercover on that battlefield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.93,1:31:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能带你过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just gonna, we can't get you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.49,1:31:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是去探探情报就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all scouted out, we'll put back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.69,1:31:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他还活着就不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as long as he's still alive, it doesn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.62,1:32:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬闯的话不可能不杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot go in there and not kill anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.50,1:32:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不通的 相信我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't. You have to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.24,1:32:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿搞来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did that come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.84,1:32:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能开吗 让我来驾驶好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I drive it? Please let me drive it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.66,1:32:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来当你的司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'll be your chauffeur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.04,1:32:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.10,1:32:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay put!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.57,1:32:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪儿搞来的 - 那边那里 全是这种车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did this come from? - A field over there. It is full of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.21,1:32:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长 我们得熟悉一下地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief, I think you and me scope out the area, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.05,1:32:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便我们进可攻退可守\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case we need to beat the haste and retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Diana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.10,1:32:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.95,1:32:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 他们有邀请函\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve, they have invitations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.18,1:32:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 冷静 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not worry. Play it cool, you go this, you got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.45,1:32:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看看您的邀请函吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your invitation, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.91,1:32:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dhanyavaad, sahib.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.90,1:32:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校和我将为你送上衷心的问候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colonel and I wish many blessings and all manner of other things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.86,1:32:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,和诚挚的祝福\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fall up in your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.19,1:32:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子里都装了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head must be empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.34,1:32:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找邀请函 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants my invitation, you idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.82,1:32:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 十分抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. I am so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.00,1:33:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我千不该万不该 我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must apologize a thousand times, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.95,1:33:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯了一个最可怕 最不可饶恕的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the most horrible, the most unforgivable mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.21,1:33:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邀请函被我弄丢了 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I lost the Colonel's invitation. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.59,1:33:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说我们一路颠簸到这里来 - 我真是没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You saying we come all the way through the mud and rain, - I'm a snail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.61,1:33:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把邀请函给我颠丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}only for you to loose my invitation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.27,1:33:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我捅娄子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am a bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.29,1:33:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我捅天大的娄子了 我就是个臭虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a bug, I'm a dung of a bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.42,1:33:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人您说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're right master…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.29,1:33:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,神会保佑您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessing will upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.45,1:33:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太荒唐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.02,1:33:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不要在这里耗一整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna be spending my evening out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.97,1:33:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个蠢货 车快开走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid idiots! Move your cars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.68,1:33:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这穿的都是些什么呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you supposed to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.89,1:34:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.27,1:34:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.17,1:34:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.78,1:34:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.98,1:34:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 可我注意你很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I have been watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.94,1:34:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续关注着你的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Following your career, I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.70,1:34:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是伊莎贝尔·丸博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Dr. Isabel Maru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.42,1:34:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,德军里最天赋异凛的化学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most talented chemist in the German army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.01,1:34:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的崇拜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.58,1:35:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm not crossing a line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.25,1:35:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你和鲁登道夫将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you and General Ludendorff are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.70,1:35:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走得很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}very close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.78,1:35:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是一起共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work well together. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.13,1:35:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样默默在背后注视你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me someone like me behind you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.53,1:35:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给你更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could provide a lot more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.42,1:35:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.66,1:35:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个配得上你才华的倾慕者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who shows you appreciation a genius like yourself deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.22,1:35:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢火 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love fire, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.45,1:35:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.47,1:35:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有序趋向无序的最佳体现\N{\fnArial\fs30}a living act of entropy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.59,1:35:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭世界的终极武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ultimate weapon of destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.99,1:35:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒着我们 到了最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reminding us that in the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.62,1:35:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不过是尘归尘 土归土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything eventually returns to the ash it came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.59,1:35:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着不禁使人感到宽慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something reassuring about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.36,1:36:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你眼中看到了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see all of that in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.05,1:36:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以给我看看你的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you could show me what you're working on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.41,1:36:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear it is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.19,1:36:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear it is extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.11,1:36:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很谢谢你对我的研究那么感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate your interest in my work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.82,1:36:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我对鲁登道夫将军很忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm loyal to General Ludendorff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.59,1:36:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.89,1:36:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经知道你的注意力在\N{\fnArial\fs30}now I see your attention is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.82,1:36:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.91,1:37:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在派对上玩得开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoying the party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.90,1:37:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不太清楚我们在庆祝什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess I'm not sure what it is we're celebrating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.93,1:37:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是德军的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}A German victory, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.02,1:37:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.94,1:37:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我听说和平很快要到来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I hear peace would be so close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.42,1:37:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.65,1:37:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会有个破停战协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only an armistice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.01,1:37:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,和永不休止的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an endless war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.85,1:37:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,修西得底斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thucydides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.98,1:37:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还懂古希腊人物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your ancient Greeks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.83,1:37:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}They understood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.77,1:37:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争是一个神\N{\fnArial\fs30}that war was a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.44,1:37:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要人类去作出牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}A god who requires human sacrifices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.09,1:37:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in exchange, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.26,1:37:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争让人类找到了目标和意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}war gives man purpose, meaning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.13,1:37:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个超越卑微自我的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}a chance to rise above his petty, mortal little self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.57,1:37:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得更加有胆识 更高贵 更优秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be courageous, noble, better!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.40,1:38:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神中只有一位对此坚信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of the many gods believed in that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.58,1:38:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.49,1:38:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都不了解神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.06,1:38:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herr General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.56,1:38:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受烟火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the fireworks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.56,1:38:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.80,1:38:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别挡路 - 戴安娜 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out of my way! - Diana, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.36,1:38:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果在找到毒气之前杀了鲁登道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill Ludendorff before we find the gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.29,1:38:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就阻止不了任何事 - 我会阻止阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We won't be able to stop anything. - I will stop Ares!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.62,1:38:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是错的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you're wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.69,1:38:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果根本就没有什么阿瑞斯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there's no Ares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.02,1:38:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.84,1:38:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can not let you do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.21,1:38:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做什么与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do is not up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.49,1:38:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.03,1:38:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.25,1:38:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.49,1:38:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,村民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The villagers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.49,1:38:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么在欢呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they cheering for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.70,1:39:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.30,1:39:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发射了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.11,1:39:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.00,1:39:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲁登道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Ludendorff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.83,1:39:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了 他在塔上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him, he was in the tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.90,1:39:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无论去哪里你都要跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever he goes you follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.38,1:39:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.33,1:39:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.58,1:40:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.89,1:40:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了 他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are dead. They are all dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.54,1:40:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以救活他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have saved them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.42,1:40:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是因为你 我可以救活他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have saved them if it weren't for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.05,1:40:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止我去杀阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stopped me from killing Ares!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.37,1:40:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Get away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.83,1:40:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand everything now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.29,1:40:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,被阿瑞斯蛊惑的不仅仅是德国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't just the Germans that Ares has corrupted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.32,1:40:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.13,1:40:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.32,1:40:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到阿瑞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find Ares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.89,1:41:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.82,1:41:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.93,1:41:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.28,1:41:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the chief!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.05,1:41:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在追踪鲁登道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He followed Ludendorff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.66,1:41:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着那烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the smoke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.84,1:41:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Diana, that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.83,1:42:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.45,1:42:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是意外啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.64,1:42:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.35,1:42:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 我还有一个地方要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, I have another matter to attend to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.53,1:42:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.13,1:42:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你就会知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will soon find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.79,1:43:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你很厉害 但还不是我的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}As magnificent as you are, you are still no match for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.62,1:43:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.81,1:43:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天堂岛的戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Diana Temiscira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.88,1:43:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚马逊人的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughter of Hippolyta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.76,1:43:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,希波吕忒的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen of the Amazons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.65,1:44:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁灭世界的怒火熄灭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your wrath upon this world is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.84,1:44:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,以这个世界的一切善良为名\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of all that it is good in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.64,1:44:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要完成亚马逊人的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hereby complete the mission of the Amazons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.49,1:44:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你在这个世界永远消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}By ridding this world of you forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.20,1:45:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.97,1:45:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.16,1:45:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀死了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.40,1:45:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀死了他 但一切还在继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him, but nothing stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.36,1:45:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果杀了战争之神 战争就会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill the god of war, you stop the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.85,1:46:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我们的当务之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what we have to do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.33,1:46:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止毒气的释放 赶紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must stop the gas. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.69,1:46:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这一切理应结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. All this should have stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.30,1:46:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.03,1:46:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争应该要结束了 为什么没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fighting should have stopped. Why are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.41,1:46:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know! I don't know. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.52,1:46:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瑞斯已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.86,1:46:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不用再打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can stop fighting now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.36,1:46:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么他们还要继续打 - 也许他们本性如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are they still fighting? - Because maybe it's them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.52,1:46:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.97,1:46:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许人类并不都是善良的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe people aren't always good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.53,1:46:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有阿瑞斯都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares or no Ares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.70,1:46:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许人类本身就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's just, who they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.01,1:46:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴安娜 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diana - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.33,1:46:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 这些我们可以等会再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, we can talk about this later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.93,1:46:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要你跟我来 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you to come with me. - No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.12,1:46:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了这么多 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything I saw, it can't be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.45,1:46:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can not be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.29,1:46:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were killing each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.57,1:46:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害那些他们看不到的人 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing people they cannot see. Children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.43,1:46:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.12,1:46:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是因为阿瑞斯 而不是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it had to be him. It can not be them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.46,1:46:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜 人类 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, people… I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.13,1:46:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.26,1:46:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.25,1:46:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说人类不值得我去拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said the world of men do not deserve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.60,1:46:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不值得我们去拯救 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't deserve our help, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.19,1:47:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 与值不值得无关 - 他们不值得我们去救\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not about deserve! - They do not deserve our help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.94,1:47:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…maybe we don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.37,1:47:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但跟那没关系 一切取决于你相信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not about that. It's about what you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.86,1:47:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经历了那么多 你以为我还不懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I get it, after what I've seen out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.09,1:47:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I wish I could tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.61,1:47:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这全都是一个人的错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there was one bad guy to blame?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.32,1:47:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.10,1:47:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all to blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.22,1:47:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.62,1:47:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但或许我有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe I am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.93,1:47:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.39,1:47:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你相信这场战争必须停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe that this war should stop…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.31,1:47:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想阻止这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.53,1:47:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就帮我一起阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me stop it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.94,1:47:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.43,1:47:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不帮忙 还会有上千人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't, there will kill thousands more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.97,1:47:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 跟我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.94,1:47:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.98,1:47:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.92,1:48:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴安娜呢 - 我们只能靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is Diana? - We are on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.66,1:48:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你看到什么了 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What did you see, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.72,1:48:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像就是一堆气泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like a bunch of gas pumps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.39,1:48:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我看不到他们要运去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't see where they're taking them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.00,1:48:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么混进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna get in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.32,1:48:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个办法 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have got an idea. Come on guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.57,1:48:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.35,1:48:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.54,1:48:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里克长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Patrick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.09,1:48:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.93,1:49:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不值得我们去拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't deserve our help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.51,1:49:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只配得上毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only deserve destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.66,1:49:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.93,1:49:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.28,1:49:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.28,1:49:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not what you thought I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.55,1:49:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.33,1:49:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.19,1:49:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的敌人 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your enemy, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.33,1:50:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一一个真正了解你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one who truly knows you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.27,1:50:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也像你一样 看透了人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who truly knows them, as you now do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.13,1:50:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类一直这样 也永远这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always been and always will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.78,1:50:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦弱 残忍 自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}weak, cruel, selfish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.89,1:50:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能干出最可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and capable of the greatest horrors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.61,1:50:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以来都希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ever wanted was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.21,1:50:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神能看到我父亲创造的人类有多邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Gods to see how evil my father's creation was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.10,1:50:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.37,1:50:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是戴安娜·舍密斯盖拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Diana Temiscira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.77,1:50:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我毁灭了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I destroyed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.57,1:50:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,希波吕忒的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughter of Hippolyta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.60,1:50:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来完成她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am here to complete her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.54,1:50:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,弑神者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.98,1:50:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.32,1:51:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是弑神者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the God Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.32,1:51:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.69,1:51:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有神才能杀死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a God can kill another God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.64,1:51:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯和亚马逊女王生下了他们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus left the child he had with the queen of the Amazon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.48,1:51:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为对抗我的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a weapon to use against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.84,1:51:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你这个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.75,1:51:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I compel you to tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.38,1:51:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.18,1:51:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是战争之神 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the god of war, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.76,1:52:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真理之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the God of truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.78,1:52:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.76,1:52:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们的手上偷走了这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stole this world from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.77,1:52:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,日复一日 他们在摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ruined it, day by day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.06,1:52:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而只有我看透了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I, the only one wise enough to see it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.74,1:52:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,却太弱而无法阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}was left too weak to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.60,1:52:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年以来 我只好孤军奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these years I have struggled alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.37,1:52:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们耳边低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whispering into their ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.54,1:52:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们想法 配方的灵感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ideas, inspiration for forms, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.36,1:52:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.43,1:52:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有让他们去使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't make them used them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.90,1:52:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争都是他们自己挑起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They start these wars on their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.96,1:52:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要安排一个停战协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I do is orchestrate an armistice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.71,1:52:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们无法不自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know they cannot keep in the hope that they destroy themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.23,1:52:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但让他们自相残杀还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is never been enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.97,1:52:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你的出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.78,1:53:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你第一次出现时 我本打算摧毁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you first arrived I was going to crush you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.51,1:53:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道 如果你能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I knew that if only you could see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.84,1:53:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神所看不到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the other gods could not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.96,1:53:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会想加入我 而我们强强联手的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you would join me, and with our powers combined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.71,1:53:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以结束所有的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could finally end all the pain, all the suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.14,1:53:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带来的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destruction they bring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.02,1:53:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以将这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we could return this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.28,1:53:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复成以前的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the paradise it was before them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.69,1:53:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.43,1:53:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.37,1:53:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远也不可能与你为伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never be a part of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.49,1:53:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我不想跟你打\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, I don't want to fight you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.28,1:53:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果真的有这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.96,1:54:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史蒂夫 - 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steve! - Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.44,1:54:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨米 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.15,1:54:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些东西给我弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get these things out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.96,1:54:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你还有很多东西要学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my dear, you have so much to learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.91,1:55:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.99,1:55:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.18,1:55:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那真的是战争之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is not much we can do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.70,1:55:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们也无计可施了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that's who I think it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.78,1:55:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们可以阻止飞机起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can stop that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.95,1:55:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能连上无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could get on the radio, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.12,1:55:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以让空军将它打下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can ask flying corp to shoot her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.41,1:55:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 如果飞机坠毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. If it crashes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.45,1:55:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,方圆50平方英里内的人都会遭殃\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will wipe everyone out for 50 square miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.66,1:55:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让它起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta ground it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.65,1:55:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息 上面有计时器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news. It is on a timer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.68,1:55:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不让它起飞 还是会泄露\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we ground it here, it's the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.06,1:56:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是易燃的吗 酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it flammable, Chief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.17,1:56:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是氢化物 所以是易燃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you said it's hydrogen. It's flammable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.63,1:56:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们给我开条道 我要到飞机上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you guys to clear me a path to that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.16,1:56:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 史蒂夫 - 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Steve! - Hey, Steve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.11,1:56:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.94,1:57:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来 这边 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! This way! Steve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.86,1:57:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赶紧 史蒂夫 - 快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Steve. - Ahead! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.27,1:57:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.66,1:58:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看你这个神有多少能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what kind of god you really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.04,1:58:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我毁灭他们的 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will help me destroy them, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.93,1:58:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你也会赔上小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.59,1:58:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快 赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Move, move, let's go! Go. Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.86,1:58:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 伙计们 走 - 赶紧往前跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move it, boys! Now! - Let's go! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.04,1:59:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这点能耐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you have to offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.18,1:59:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不可能赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is futile to imagine you can win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.84,1:59:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃吧 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give up, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.64,1:59:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长 还有弹药吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief! Anything left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.11,1:59:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.15,1:59:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么都行 - 没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.26,2:00:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.79,2:01:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.61,2:01:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.04,2:01:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.63,2:01:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.38,2:01:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.01,2:01:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.69,2:01:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是人类造成的 与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind did this, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.33,2:02:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们丑陋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.30,2:02:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,满腔怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filled with hatred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.71,2:02:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦弱无能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.13,2:02:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的特雷弗上尉一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your captain Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.37,2:02:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,连死都没有为你留下什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone and left you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.05,2:02:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.47,2:02:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.13,2:02:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他活该被烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserved to burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.95,2:02:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着她 然后告诉我 我是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her and tell me I'm wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.82,2:02:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是这些人类中最典型的例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the perfect example of these humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.60,2:02:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不值得你的同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unworthy of your sympathy in every way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.77,2:02:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了她 戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy her, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.99,2:03:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是她活该 他们都活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that she deserves. And they all do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.85,2:03:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.86,2:03:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.18,2:03:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.82,2:03:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.50,2:03:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.74,2:03:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.65,2:03:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.32,2:03:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是什么 我都可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, I can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.22,2:03:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.83,2:03:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我来 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me do it. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.58,2:03:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定得是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.20,2:03:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定得是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.16,2:03:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来拯救今天 你来拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save today. You can save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.22,2:03:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们有更多的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we had more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.24,2:04:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.60,2:04:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.63,2:04:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他们的看法是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are wrong about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.87,2:04:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的确像你所说那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are everything you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.61,2:04:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不仅如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But so much more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.88,2:04:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.65,2:05:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不值得你的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not deserve your protection!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.14,2:05:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,与值不值得无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.36,2:05:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是你相信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about what you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.64,2:05:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我相信爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.09,2:05:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我毁了你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will destroy you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.53,2:05:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.35,2:09:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去我总想着拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to want to save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.82,2:09:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束战争 给人类带来和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}To end war and bring peace to mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.15,2:09:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我瞥见到那所谓的光明中潜藏的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I glimpsed the darkness that lives within their light, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.90,2:09:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,意识到原来在每个人心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and learned that inside every one of them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.96,2:09:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都有善恶两面\N{\fnArial\fs30}there will always be both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.11,2:09:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都需要自己作出抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}A choice each must make for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.15,2:09:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是任何英雄都无法代劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something no hero will ever defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.70,2:09:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我终于知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.24,2:09:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有爱能真正拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}that only love can truly save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.65,2:10:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我留下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.49,2:10:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为之抗争 付出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight and I give.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.62,2:10:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了自己心中那美好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the world I know can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.13,2:10:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我现在的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my mission now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.77,2:10:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.{\r}
